// Get Out Of Town (Cole Porter, 1938)

Tempo 70
Keysig G minor

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove DescendingJazzIntro

AllGrooves Bass-Chord Octave 5

Begin Solo
    Voice JazzGuitar
    Octave 5
    Articulate 120
    Harmony OpenBelow
    Volume f
    Begin Riff
        8g;f#;4fn;2en;
        8e;d;4d&;2c;
        8b&-;bn-;c;c#;dn;e&;en;fn;
        1f#;
    End
End


Swingmode On
cresc m mf 4

1        Gm
2       Ebm
3       Bbm
4        D7

Repeat
Groove DescendingJazz
Volume m

5        Gm
6         /
7       Gm6
8         /

Groove DescendingJazzPlus
Volume p

9        Gm
10        /
11        /
12     BbM7      /    Bb6

Groove DescendingJazz
Volume mf

13      Gm6
14       F7
15       F6
16    Edim7

Groove DescendingJazzSus

17      Eb6
18        A
19        D
20       D7

Groove DescendingJazzSusPlus
Volume p

21        G
22        /
23      Gm6
24        /      /      /     Gm

Groove DescendingJazzSus
Cresc mp mf 4

25        /
26        /      /      D     Gm
27      Fm6
28       G7

Groove DescendingJazzPlus

29       Cm
30      Ebm      /   Ebm6
31       Bb      /      z
32      Fm6      /     E+     G7

Groove DescendingJazz
Volume f

33       Cm
34     Ebm6      /     F7
Volume mp

RepeatEnding

35       Bb
36   F#dim7      /   D7b9

RepeatEnd

Groove DescendingJazzEnd
